0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 camera-health-check skill 文档","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/camera-health-check/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_140baca4a83448f0b7b75e8c","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9112,"output_tokens":111,"total_tokens":9223,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":30}}},{"content":"---\nname: camera-health-check\ndescription: Check video monitoring camera quality from sampled frames and return health status before downstream event generation. Use when Codex has camera_id and frames and needs to gate or downgrade event confidence for offline, unavailable, degraded, black-screen, blurred, occluded, frozen, corrupted, or shifted camera feeds.\n---\n\n# Camera Health Check\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf `frames` are missing but the user provided a video source, do not ask the user to provide frames and do not write custom camera diagnostics. First call `frame-sampling/scripts/run.py` to generate frames, then call this skill.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython camera-health-check/scripts/run.py --frames-json <frames.json> --camera-id <camera_id> --config <config.json> --output <health.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--frames-json`, `--camera-id`, `--health-status`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read camera id and sampled frames.\n2. Check frame availability and configured/manual health overrides.\n3. Compute or accept quality signals for black screen, blur, occlusion, freeze, corruption, and view shift.\n4. Return health status, health score, and issue reasons.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `camera_id`\n- `frames`\n- Optional `health_status` override\n- Optional `context.config[\"camera_health\"][camera_id]` override\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `health_status`, `health_score`, and `issues`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\nThe current implementation returns success with `health_status=\"unavailable\"` when no frames are available.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not create events or evidence. Low quality should reduce downstream confidence or trigger review.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"8ed636be-352a-4ec9-b310-0ff5f6a9013b","tool_call_id":"call_140baca4a83448f0b7b75e8c","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在执行您提供的 bash 命令：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":239,"prompt_tokens":9687,"total_tokens":9926,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":239},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9687}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-6cf90b31-17d5-9466-b267-89840324c402","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e628f-100e-70b2-ac44-08960813c905-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 camera-health-check 真链路测试命令","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/camera-health-check /mnt/user-data/workspace/camera-health-check && python /mnt/skills/custom/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --capture-seconds 5 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir /mnt/user-data/workspace/camera-health-check/frames --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/workspace/camera-health-check/frames.json && python /mnt/skills/custom/camera-health-check/scripts/run.py --frames-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/camera-health-check/frames.json --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/camera-health-check/result.json"},"id":"call_c162ebfc862f4b0da9e94ebd","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9687,"output_tokens":239,"total_tokens":9926,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"{\n  \"skill\": \"frame-sampling\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"confidence\": 1.0,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n    \"frames\": [\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000000800_0001\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:00+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/camera-health-check/frames/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000000800_0001.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 1,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 0.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000010800_0002\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:01+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/camera-health-check/frames/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000010800_0002.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 2,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 1.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000020800_0003\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:02+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/camera-health-check/frames